# Files that must never be served publicly.
#
# Cloudflare serves this whole repo root as static assets, so anything not
# listed here ships to the CDN. The deployed surface is:
#   flechas/          the live game (index, cascada, clasico)
#   *.html at root    redirect stubs for old workers.dev links
#
# Everything below is source material, docs or work in progress.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
.DS_Store
wrangler.jsonc
*.command
*.webloc
_assets
_docs
_archive
_wip
_reference
